{
"classname" "game_messagebox"
"origin" "-472 -424 264"
"targetname" "info_worldtext"
"title" "World text"
"message" "Every text here is a point_worldtext with Orientation Stationary (0). A text is read looking the way the entity points, so its arrow in the editor points into the wall it is on, and it only has one side. Each text sits 1 unit in front of its wall.\n\nTexts that turn to face the player (Orientation 1 or 2) cut into walls and change as you move, so use stationary texts for signs and labels.\n\nThe button fires a trigger_changevalue that sets the message of the named text changing_text."
}
